# Shell scripts must keep LF in every checkout. This machine's git converts
# text to CRLF on checkout; a CRLF hook passes "-PrePush\r" to PowerShell on
# Windows and has a broken "#!/bin/sh\r" shebang on Linux -- the push gate
# would fail to run exactly where it is meant to guard.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
